{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00454","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音 肃和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄鸟司春，苍龙登岁。\n节物变柳，光风转蕙。\n瑶席降神，朱弦飨帝。\n诚备祝嘏，礼殚珪币。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}